</span>Answer:<span id="A2.SS1.p3.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Yes</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS1.p3.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p3.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Generated CoT:<span id="A2.SS1.p3.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A2.I2" class="ltx_enumerate">
<span id="A2.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<span id="A2.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A2.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">PHQ-9 is sometimes used in psychiatry.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A2.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<span id="A2.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A2.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I2.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">It measures depression symptoms.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A2.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<span id="A2.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A2.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I2.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Some patients changed treatment after using it.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A2.I2.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4.</span> 
<span id="A2.I2.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A2.I2.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I2.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Therefore, it is helpful.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.SS1.p3.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p3.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Scores:<span id="A2.SS1.p3.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Coverage = 3.2, Factual Accuracy = 3.5, Redundancy = 0.6</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
