<span id="A2.SS1.p4.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p4.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Question:<span id="A2.SS1.p4.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Systematic use of patient-rated depression severity monitoring: is it helpful and feasible in clinical psychiatry?
</span>Answer:<span id="A2.SS1.p4.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Yes</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS1.p4.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p4.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Generated CoT:<span id="A2.SS1.p4.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A2.I3" class="ltx_enumerate">
<span id="A2.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
